		"description": "<p>With a violent arc of your weapon, you batter your foes away like pieces across the chessboard with a wave of force. Choose up to 3 targets within your reach to make Strength saving throws. On a failed save, each target takes Basic Melee force damage and is pushed directly away from you 3 squares. If they collide with an object or creature, deal your weapon’s damage to the object or basic melee damage to the creature. On a successful save they take no damage and are not pushed.</p>",
